{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PYvvR5w8QjNPh7y8kCyXXY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tSee full report on server: /root/autodl-tmp/struct_self_consist_ie/output/exp_012_logprob/analysis_report.json\n2\t\n3\tKey results:\n4\tNER Full (n=529): SJ rho=0.3565 >> logprob rho=0.1396, AUROC 0.689 vs 0.591\n5\tNER Cond (n=501): SJ rho=0.4120 >> logprob rho=0.1627, AUROC 0.706 vs 0.597\n6\tRE Full (n=397): logprob rho=0.2467 > SJ rho=0.2112 (marginal, delta=0.036), but FK rho=0.2528 beats both\n7\tRE Cond (n=296): SJ rho=0.3683 >> logprob rho=0.1457, AUROC 0.684 vs 0.549\n8\t\n9\tVerdict: SJ wins NER decisively; RE full is mixed but SJ wins conditional set by large margin."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011DogXd4g4e3rCmrYaiudDi","session_id":"bee9bcb9-e915-4303-a88d-b9f96b0f305a","uuid":"76f5cfed-2064-4991-867b-26d960c7358a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T11:54:34.911Z"}
